## 1. Glassdoor Interview Experience

### Official Platform Link

[https://www.glassdoor.com](https://www.glassdoor.com)

### Country / Primary Region

United States

### Content Ownership

Mostly user-generated. Interview reviews are posted anonymously by candidates and moderated by Glassdoor through automated systems, human review, and user reports.

### Content Type

Mostly semi-structured interview review data. It combines structured fields such as company, role, date, result, difficulty, sentiment, and location with free-text interview descriptions.

### Company / Role / Content

Covers many companies and roles. A typical entry may include role, candidate type, application method, interview process, offer status, difficulty, and questions asked.

### Notes

Useful as a broad interview-experience source because it combines candidate stories with company-level review and salary context.

### Main Content Types

- Interview reviews
- Interview questions
- Difficulty ratings
- Experience sentiment
- Application source
- Offer outcome
- Free-text process descriptions

